'''Elderwood Revolver''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
It resembles a tree bark, hence the name. Its barrel and frame, alongside its accents, are dark green in color with minor cracks on them. The barrel has some purple geometrical shapes on it, and the cylinder’s chambers are also purple. The handle, resembling a tree trunk, is dark purple, which also wraps around the frame and trigger.  

== Trivia== 
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It had a different picture upon release.
*It partners with the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife [[Elderwood Scythe]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Elderwood Set|Elderwood Set]].
*It is also part of the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Full_Elderwood_Set Full Elderwood Set] with [[Elderwood Scythe]] and [[Elderwood Blade]].
*There are [[Blue Elderwood|blue]], [[Bronze Elderwood|bronze]], [[Silver Elderwood|silver]], and [[Gold Elderwood|gold]] reskin variants of this gun, which were released as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] trophies.
*Unlike most weapons, it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

